---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer" description="Disclaimer of Rozgar Raasta Pakistan — important limits on the information we publish.">
	<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
		<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl">Disclaimer</h1>
		<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: 26 November 2026</p>
		<div class="prose-rrp mt-6">
			<h2>General information only</h2>
			<p>All content on Rozgar Raasta Pakistan is general information, not professional, legal, financial or immigration advice. Always confirm important details with the official source.</p>
			<h2>We are not the employer</h2>
			<p>We are not an employer, recruitment agency, university, bank or government department. Applying for a job, course or scholarship is a matter between you and the organisation concerned.</p>
			<h2>No guarantee of results</h2>
			<p>We do not guarantee that you will get a job, an interview, admission, a scholarship or any income by following our guides or applying for a listed opportunity.</p>
			<h2>Earning claims</h2>
			<p>Any mention of earning potential on this site is descriptive, not a promise. Freelancing and online earning depend on your skills, effort, market demand and the platform's rules. Income is never guaranteed.</p>
			<h2>Scam warning</h2>
			<p>No genuine employer charges you to apply for a job. If anyone asks you to pay a fee, share your CNIC or bank details, or buy a "job package", treat it as a scam and do not pay. Read our guide <a href="/guides/how-to-avoid-job-scams-in-pakistan">How to Avoid Job Scams in Pakistan</a>.</p>
			<h2>External websites</h2>
			<p>We link to official and reputable third-party websites. We do not control them and are not responsible for their content or for what happens after you leave our site.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
